    },
    {
      "text": "Volunteer to remove invasive plants Help us protect our parks and green spaces by removing invasive plants along the Shoreline Trail. Join us for one of our monthly events! Learn more at portmoody.ca/",
      "href": "https://www.portmoody.ca/parks-recreation-and-environment/environment/"
    },
    {
      "text": "Be bear aware We live in bear country! Managing access to garbage and other attractants is the most important action to take to keep people and bears safe in our community.",
